{"id": "46938", "title": "一只绣花鞋", "author": "张宝瑞", "category": "历史军事", "count": 31, "available": 11, "cover": "files/article/image/46/46938/46938s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/46/46938.htm", "intro": "《一只绣花鞋》故事的产生和繁衍，几种手抄本的辗转流传，有其深刻的历史渊源。手抄本文学现象是中国文学史上一种特殊的文化现象，因为它诞生于“文革”时期这一特殊的历史环境。在“文革”中流传最广的手抄本之一就是《一只绣花鞋》。实际上，这部书中所写的梅花党故事就像一个幽灵，在中国民间已游荡了半个多世纪……", "base": "files/article/html/46/46938", "chapters": [{"title": "正文一", "volume": true}, {"title": "一、凶手是谁？", "file": "6370903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二、火葬场的秘密", "file": "6370904.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三、金陵魔窟", "file": "6370905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四、引蛇出洞", "file": "6370906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五、梅花党在香港", "file": "6370907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六、夏雨将军死了", "file": "6370908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七、一只绣花鞋", "file": "6370909.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八、人头皮箱", "file": "6370910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九、抱皮包的空中小姐", "file": "6370911.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十、圆山魔影", "file": "6370912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文二", "volume": true}, {"title": "十一、虎穴献图", "file": "6370914.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十二、龙山寺会晤", "file": "6370915.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十三、勇救南云", "file": "6370916.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十四、12幅美男子像", "file": "6370917.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十五、生活的颤音", "file": "6370918.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十六、公园里的人皮炸药", "file": "6370919.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十七、绿色的尸体", "file": "6370920.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十八、漓江谍影", "file": "6370921.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十九、金三角的“爱情”", "file": "6370922.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二十、四名劫机犯", "file": "6370923.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文三", "volume": true}, {"title": "二十一、巴黎留学的靓女", "file": "6370925.html", "available": true}, {"title": "二十二、神秘的旅伴", "file": "6370926.html", "available": true